'''Gravel''' is a {{Common}} collection block found in a small ravine in the {{Zone|Spider's Den}}. It can also be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Pat}}.

== Collection ==
Collecting gravel increases the player's gravel [[Collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of gravel.<br>

''Note: Although there is a chance for flint when mining gravel, it will always count towards your collection regardless of what you receive. ''

{{/Collection UI}}

{{CollectionTable|Gravel}}

== Obtaining ==
=== Natural Generation ===
'''Gravel''' generates near the ravine in {{Zone|Spider's Den}}, located at {{Coordinates|-257|70|-327}}. Commonly spawns within the lower section of the Den.

